// `Action::GainControl` outside an exchange-family macro's body: one-shot
// control transitions are the exchange primitive ([CR#701.12b]); a
// duration-bounded "gain control until end of turn" is the continuous
// layer-2 form, not this verb — load-capped like `Simultaneous`.
Normal(
  name: "Reject Bare Gain Control",
  types: [Sorcery],
  abilities: [
    Spell(effect: Targeted(
      targets: [Target(Exactly(1), Type(Creature))],
      effect: GainControl(Target(0), You),
    )),
  ],
)
